Description: SecuBox RustDesk — self-hosted remote desktop relay
 Hosts RustDesk hbbs (signal) and hbbr (relay) servers in a Debian LXC at
 10.100.0.90 on br-lxc. Two separate systemd units inside the LXC for the
 two daemons; rustdeskctl components surfaces both as independent.
 .
 Public exposure does not use mitmproxy (it cannot inspect the raw UDP
 NAT-traversal traffic on 21116/udp). HAProxy stream-mode handles
 21115/tcp, 21116/tcp, 21117/tcp; nftables DNAT handles 21116/udp.
 .
 rustdeskctl exposes the canonical SecuBox three-fold introspection plus
 peer/relay/key/session nouns matching the REMOTE-ACCESS layer of the CTL
 grammar (sister to OPS MONITORING / SEARCH).
